WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.120
A speaker cone at the front of a hall
pushes and pulls on the air beside it.

2
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:09.530
Between the speaker and the back
row there is nothing but still air.

3
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:13.040
A split second later, the
listener at the back hears it.

4
00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:18.120
So did any air actually travel from
the speaker to the listener's ear?

5
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:21.630
In this mission, you'll
strike a long steel rail once,

6
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:25.200
and hear the blow twice:
after a fifth of a second,

7
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.210
and again after 2.9 seconds.

8
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.340
Then you'll find out what the
source decides about a sound wave,

9
00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:33.810
and what the material decides.

10
00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:37.660
Your mission: find out whether
any air makes the journey,

11
00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.080
and explain your answer.
